# Defense-in-depth on top of secretlint's .gitignore cascade — do not rely
# on gitignore cascade alone (it did not reliably apply, in a sibling
# project's testing, when a scan's cwd differs from the scanned path's own
# directory tree). Every credential-shaped file in this repo is listed
# explicitly here so it is never scanned or echoed, regardless of how the
# tool is invoked.
